One God
Calah Rhodes
Key: [C]

{comment: Verse 1}
[Bb]Hear all people, God is [C]one
[Dm]Hear all nations, God is [Am]one
[Bb]Love the Lord with all your [C]heart
[Dm]With all your soul, with all your [Am]might

{comment: Pre-Chorus}
[F]We are the generation
To [Am]stand and declare salvation
Through[Dm]out the world, we're [Am]gonna let it [Gsus]ring [G]

{comment: Chorus}
We believe there's only [Am]one God, [F]one Lord, [C]one faith [G]
We believe there's only [Am]one name, [F]one way to [C]be saved [G]
It's through the mighty name of [Am]Jesus, Je[F]sus, Je[C/E]sus [G/B]
Shout the the saving name of [Am]Jesus, [F]Jesus, Je[C]sus

{comment: If return to verse or end}
[F-][E-][C-][G-][E-][D-][A-]

{comment: Bridge}
[Dm]Our God is one
[F]Our God is one
[C]Our God is one
[G/B]His name is Jesus

{comment: To return to chorus}
